  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "이봐! MZ단 친구!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BD1000210020004D005AB2E80020CE5CAD6C0021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사람 하나 도와줬으면 하는데,\n대답은 물론 오케이겠지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB78C0020D558B0980020B3C4C640C92CC73CBA740020D558B294B370002C000AB300B2F5C7400020BB3CB8600020C624CF00C774ACA0C9C0003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B12400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B124002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇게 나와야지.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AC8C0020B098C640C57CC9C0002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저 지하 수도 안에서\n비명이 들렸거든.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8000020C9C0D5580020C218B3C40020C548C5D0C11C000ABE44BA85C7740020B4E4B838AC70B4E0002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 조사를 해 보고 싶은데,\n지하 수도에는 무서운 고스트타입 포켓몬이<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n있다는 이야기를 들어서 말이야...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020C870C0ACB97C0020D5740020BCF4ACE00020C2F6C740B370002C000AC9C0D5580020C218B3C4C5D0B2940020BB34C11CC6B40020ACE0C2A4D2B8D0C0C7850020D3ECCF13BAACC77400100001BE00000AC788B2E4B2940020C774C57CAE30B97C0020B4E4C5B4C11C0020B9D0C774C57C002E002E002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "카라스바 님이 인정한\n네가 좀 도와줬으면 하는데, 괜찮지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CE74B77CC2A4BC140020B2D8C7740020C778C815D55C000AB124AC000020C8800020B3C4C640C92CC73CBA740020D558B294B370002C0020AD1CCC2EC9C0003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "겁먹어서 그러는 건 아니니까\n오해하지 말라고!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC81BA39C5B4C11C0020ADF8B7ECB2940020AC740020C544B2C8B2C8AE4C000AC624D574D558C9C00020B9D0B77CACE00021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너, 강한 트레이너라며?\n도시를 위해 군소리 말고 협력하라고! 응!?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108002C0020AC15D55C0020D2B8B808C774B108B77CBA70003F000AB3C4C2DCB97C0020C704D5740020AD70C18CB9AC0020B9D0ACE00020D611B825D558B77CACE000210020C7510021003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
