      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CC640C640C640C640C640C655002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데스니칸이 화를 내며\n공격해 왔다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B370C2A4B2C8CE78C7740020D654B97C0020B0B4BA70000AACF5ACA9D5740020C654B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿0",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00300000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "구우...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD6CC6B0002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데스니칸의 몸 안에\n갇힌 사람은 없는 것 같다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B370C2A4B2C8CE78C7580020BAB80020C548C5D0000AAC07D78C0020C0ACB78CC7400020C5C6B2940020AC830020AC19B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데스니칸은 사라져 버렸다...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B370C2A4B2C8CE78C7400020C0ACB77CC8380020BC84B838B2E4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "사라지면서\n무언가를 떨어뜨린 것 같다...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0ACB77CC9C0BA74C11C000ABB34C5B8AC00B97C0020B5A8C5B4B728B9B00020AC830020AC19B2E4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지하 수도에는\n데스니칸의 기척이 남아 있다...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0D5580020C218B3C4C5D0B294000AB370C2A4B2C8CE78C7580020AE30CC99C7740020B0A8C5440020C788B2E4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿6",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00360000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "윽, 눈부셔!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C73D002C0020B208BD80C1540021002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괜찮으세요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD1CCC2EC73CC138C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "무슨 일이 있던 거예요?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB34C2A80020C77CC7740020C788B3580020AC70C608C694003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그게... 부끄럽지만\n미르에서는 희귀한 포켓몬인<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n데스니칸을 보고 너무 흥분해 버려서요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8AC8C002E002E002E0020BD80B044B7FDC9C0B9CC000ABBF8B974C5D0C11CB2940020D76CADC0D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC77800100001BE00000AB370C2A4B2C8CE78C7440020BCF4ACE00020B108BB340020D765BD84D5740020BC84B824C11CC694002E002E002E00100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정신없이 소리를 질렀는데,\n데스니칸이 듣기에 많이 시끄러웠나 봐요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815C2E0C5C6C7740020C18CB9ACB97C0020C9C8B800B294B370002C000AB370C2A4B2C8CE78C7740020B4E3AE30C5D00020B9CEC7740020C2DCB044B7ECC6E0B0980020BD10C694002E00100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서 화가 난 데스니칸의 안에\n갇혀 버린 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C0020D654AC000020B09C0020B370C2A4B2C8CE78C7580020C548C5D0000AAC07D6000020BC84B9B00020AC70C608C694002E00100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠이 솔솔 올 정도로 편안해서\n하마터면 더 깊은 잠에 빠질 뻔했어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C7740020C194C1940020C62C0020C815B3C4B85C0020D3B8C548D574C11C000AD558B9C8D130BA740020B3540020AE4AC7400020C7A0C5D00020BE60C9C80020BED4D588C5B4C694002E00100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무튼, 꺼내 주셔서\n정말 감사해요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB34D2BC002C0020AEBCB0B40020C8FCC154C11C000AC815B9D00020AC10C0ACD574C694002100100002011401D60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "데스니칸의 몸 안에\n갇힌 사람이 있을지도 몰라.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n가서 데스니칸을 찾아 봐.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B370C2A4B2C8CE78C7580020BAB80020C548C5D0000AAC07D78C0020C0ACB78CC7740020C788C744C9C0B3C40020BAB0B77C002E00100001BE01000AAC00C11C0020B370C2A4B2C8CE78C7440020CC3EC5440020BD10002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿@",
