      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00400000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아주 잘했어!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544C8FC0020C798D588C5B40021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "비명 소리의 주인이 무사해서 다행이야.\n대단한 활약인걸!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE44BA850020C18CB9ACC7580020C8FCC778C7740020BB34C0ACD574C11C0020B2E4D589C774C57C002E000AB300B2E8D55C0020D65CC57DC778AC780021001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너도 미르를 위해\n좋은 일을 해서 뿌듯하지?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108B3C40020BBF8B974B97C0020C704D574000AC88BC7400020C77CC7440020D574C11C0020BFCCB4EFD558C9C0003F001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "말을 걸어 준 내게\n감사하도록 하라고.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C9000020B0B4AC8C000AAC10C0ACD558B3C4B85D0020D558B77CACE0002E001000020114001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뒤에...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 3664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B4A4C5D0002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
